50238a8dea81f7ee77d7514fa925c47.webp?t=1751286575\" width=616 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/e3b96c2de5c0817f63abe343b3fa0fe2.poster.avif?t=1751286575\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/e3b96c2de5c0817f63abe343b3fa0fe2.webm?t=1751286575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Step into an expansive world where no two survival experiences are the same. Explore dense forests, frozen rivers, and desolate plains, each biome presenting unique challenges. Scavenge through abandoned cabins, cut down trees for firewood, and fish in icy waters. But beware\u2014every sound in the distance could mean danger, and the deeper you venture, the deadlier it becomes. The open world of <strong>ANGST</strong> is as beautiful as it is brutal, and only the most prepared will survive its many dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/3070f8e7d9bfde6b1d8baf5f6e71ace5.webp?t=1751286575\" width=616 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/2c225e05448253615e93d600562cc96e.poster.avif?t=1751286575\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/2c225e05448253615e93d600562cc96e.webm?t=1751286575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/2c225e05448253615e93d600562cc96e.mp4?t=1751286575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the wilderness of ANGST alone or with friends. In online co-op mode, team up with others to explore The Hollow together. Share resources, fight side by side against predators, and work shoulder to shoulder to craft tools and build shelter. Brave the hostile environment, uncover its secrets, and see how long you can survive in this frozen limbo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/00f6d504878765856442e44753f3a23f.poster.avif?t=1751286575\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/00f6d504878765856442e44753f3a23f.webm?t=1751286575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/00f6d504878765856442e44753f3a23f.mp4?t=1751286575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "ANGST is a solo &amp; co-op wilderness survival game set in a freezing, gritty, stylized Low-Poly limbo-like world. Craft tools and weapons, hunt, fish, and fight to stay alive. Upgrade skills to venture deeper into the wild, but be warned: what lurks there can thwart your plans. Survive the ANGST!",
